AI Prompt

You are a Senior PowerShell Developer, Windows Forms Developer, and Outlook COM Automation Expert.

Your task is to build a production-ready Windows PowerShell application for Microsoft Outlook.

The final solution must be written in Windows PowerShell 5.1 and must not require any third-party modules.

The solution must be fully commented, modular, and production quality.

