⸻

Application Purpose

Our office scanner sends scanned documents to Outlook as email attachments.

The application should automatically download all PDF attachments from the scanner emails within a selected date range.

⸻

Outlook Requirements

The application must automatically:

* Detect whether Outlook is running.
* If Outlook is closed, automatically open Outlook.
* Wait until Outlook is fully initialized.
* Connect to the current Outlook profile.
* Connect using Outlook COM only.
* Do not use Microsoft Graph.
* Do not use Exchange Web Services.
* Do not use Outlook REST API.

